From: Wenyou Yang <wenyou.yang-AIFe0yeh4nAAvxtiuMwx3w@public.gmane.org>
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] power: act8945a_charger: Add status change update support
Date: Fri, 24 Jun 2016 15:17:36 +0800
Message-ID: <1466752660-2922-4-git-send-email-wenyou.yang@atmel.com>
References: <1466752660-2922-1-git-send-email-wenyou.yang@atmel.com>
Mime-Version: 1.0
